 "Each bar runs from birth to death, or to today for the living. Pale bars with no end: dead, year unknown. Dashed: birth year estimated from kin.": "每條長條從出生延伸至逝世，在世者則延伸至今日。淡色且無終點的長條：已逝世，年份不詳。虛線：出生年份由親屬推估。",
 "Each box is a house: the couple on top, their children inside; ▾ folds a house away. The dot beside each name follows the color chosen here.": "每個方框是一個家：夫妻在上，子女在內；▾ 可收合一個家。每個姓名旁的圓點依此處所選的顏色顯示。",
 "Each case gives where the practice is taught, and the case against it in the words of Scripture and the stronger traditions, every quotation checked against its source.": "每個案例都列出此做法在何處被教導，以及聖經與較有分量之傳統的反對論據，每段引文皆已對照原始出處。",
 "Each draft shows where it comes from; confirm what the house keeps, retire what it does not (with the reason), and pass over what you want to come back to.": "每份草稿都標明出處；確認本家所持守的，廢止不持守的（並附理由），想稍後再處理的則略過。",
 "Each father's line, through men only, from its first known man to the men living now. The heavy line is the main line: eldest son after eldest son, passing to the next brother where a line has no living man. Younger sons' lines branch below it.": "每一父系只經由男子，從最早可知的一人畫到今日在世的男子。粗線是大宗：長子傳長子，某一支若已無在世男子，便傳給下一個兄弟。次子以下的支系在其下分出。",
 "Each house's head sits at its center. Zoom in to read every name; click a dot for their card, double-click to stand there.": "每家的家長位於其中心。放大即可看見每個名字；點一下圓點看其資料卡，點兩下則站到其位置。",
 "Each person sits at the height of their birth year (estimated from kin when no date is recorded), so the generations read from top to bottom.": "每個人依出生年份排列高度（未記錄日期時由親屬推估），因此世代由上而下排列。",
 "Each ring is a degree of kinship: one for every step up to a common ancestor and down again. A husband or wife has no degree and sits beside you. In-laws (dashed) take the degree of the one through whom they come.": "每一圈代表一個親等：上溯至共同祖先、再下行，每一步算一等。丈夫或妻子不計親等，位於你身旁。姻親（虛線）依其所由而來之人的親等計算。",
