 "Every living soul of the family, inside the house of the man who keeps them. The houses of one father's line sit together in a dashed outline; the great circle is the whole family under its Head.": "家族中每一位在世者，都畫在照管他的那人之家中。同一父系的各家聚在一條虛線內；大圓是族長之下的整個家族。",
